cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  This repository is an independent reimplementation of the framework described
  in the paper below. If you are using the ideas, please cite the paper. If you
  are referring to this software specifically, cite both.
title: "RSIAgent: an independent reimplementation"
abstract: >-
  A training-free, multi-agent framework for recursive self-improvement in new
  environments. A Curriculum Agent, an Actor Agent, and a Verifier Agent
  recursively explore an unfamiliar environment and consolidate what they learn
  into reusable memory, without updating model weights. Implements the reference
  lifecycle (Algorithm A1) and stage-ablation protocol of arXiv:2609.15364,
  decoupled from the original's QEMU/Docker benchmark harness.
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
